%% Fase 1: Fundacao — Schema + Rotas + Layout Split Panels

flowchart TD
    START["Fase 1: Fundacao"] --> S1["Criar tabela tournament_library<br/>em shared/schema.ts"]
    S1 --> S2["Criar tabela tournament_library_settings<br/>em shared/schema.ts"]
    S2 --> S3["Adicionar campos grade_start_hour<br/>e grade_end_hour em user_settings"]
